{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26935","headline":"和卢给事酬裴员外 · 姚合","name":"和卢给事酬裴员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南山雪色彻皇州，钟鼓声交晓气浮。\n鸳鹭簪裾上龙尾，蓬莱宫殿压鳌头。\n夕郎夜直吟仙掖，天乐和声下禁楼。\n赠荅诗成才思敌，病夫欲和几朝愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26935.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26935","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}